      "writtenOn": "2022-07-26T04:40:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To follow the existing usage, maybe this should be:\n\n#define espi_dev DEVICE_DT_GET(DT_CHOSEN(cros_ec_espi))\n\nI think rather than saving this as a static, using DEVICE_DT_GET will get\nyou a pointer to the global device instance, so you don\u0027t have to save it,\njust use that directly.",
      "revId": "b13e2b1c3fb488dda303b9250c4bebc40aae3336",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
